<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - OSHAP a Lehman buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - OSHAP a Lehman buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it started coverage of OSHAP Technologies Ltd with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/8 to 4-1/4 in U.S. trading.</p>
